<h2>Activate your account</h2>
<p>Hello <strong>{{username}}</strong>,</p>
<p>Thanks for signing up! Click the button below to confirm
  <strong>{{email}}</strong>
  and activate your account.</p>
{{#if activationCode}}
  <p>Or enter this activation code:</p>
  <p><code>{{activationCode}}</code></p>
{{/if}}